  "prefLabel": "Nuh 102.06 Preceptor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 102.06 \"Preceptor\" means a licensed nursing home administrator, in good standing, with a minimum of 5 years experience who supervises administrators in training.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
